[7:15p.m.] #TrafficUpdate #SmoothFlow 

Thanks to the tireless efforts of our Men spread across the roads in Lagos, it is a smooth ride as you drive through; from Ojo on the Lagos-Badagry Expressway, through Ajah, Surulere, Igando, Apongbon, Agege, and Marina, traffic is smooth.

If you happen to see your Brothers and Sisters working to make traffic flow seamlessly, compliment them because without 'U', there is no 'US'. 

Remember to keep it within regulated and safe speed limits, Drive Carefully, and don't drive under the influence of alcohol or drugs (medication included).
